; SK65sw50 (SGOLD): WAP browser over bt-pan_SG without a SIM / cell network. v3
; Generated by bt-pan/port-browser-sk65.py. Apply only to a stock SK65v50. Untested on the phone.
; Over the installed v2 use bt-pan-browser-gprs_SK65v50.vkp instead.
;
; The browser checks the cell registration and whether its GPRS channel is usable before it asks
; LMAN for the profile; without a SIM: "network not available". While bt-pan is connected (its LMAN
; gateway reports ready) both pass and the browser takes the GPRS channel; otherwise stock.
; Uses A10FFE00..A10FFEF7 and 8 bytes of the trace string A073FC84.

